{"wikiPageId":2574993,"title":"町田啓太","genre":"Q5","wikiRevisionId":111571824,"wikiFetchedAt":"2026-11-04T09:25:02.891Z","summary":"町田 啓太 は、日本の俳優。群馬県吾妻郡東吾妻町出身。LDH JAPAN所属。妻は女優の玄理。","imageUrl":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/aa/Machida_Keita_from_%22jam%22_at_Opening_Ceremony_of_the_Tokyo_International_Film_Festival_2018_%2831746966228%29.jpg/960px-Machida_Keita_from_%22jam%22_at_Opening_Ceremony_of_the_Tokyo_International_Film_Festival_2018_%2831746966228%29.jpg?utm_source=ja.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","imageCredit":"Dick Thomas Johnson from Tokyo, Japan・CC BY 2.0（Wikimedia Commons）","rarity":"legendary","monthlyPageviews":61269,"pageviewsMeasuredAt":"2026-11-04T09:25:02.891Z","isActive":true}
